        "answer": {
          "short": "Mean: $20.05$ red cards; median: $18$ red cards; range: $32$ red cards.",
          "worked": "The $20$ values total $401$ red cards.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{401}{20}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=20.05\\text{ red cards}\\end{align*}$$\nThe 10th and 11th ordered values are both $18$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{18+18}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=18\\text{ red cards}\\\\\\text{Range}&=46-14\\\\\\text{Range}&=32\\text{ red cards}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
